Let $F:S\to X$ be a tangent box of $g:C\to X$. Transport along the fibers of $\operatorname{pr}_i$ gives holomorphic bundle isomorphisms $$\label{eq:transport}
\Theta_i:\operatorname{pr}_i^*(g^*E_i)\xrightarrow{\ \sim\ }F^*E_i,
\qquad i=1,2,$$ whose restrictions to the diagonal are the identity.
